WEBVTT

00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:05.680
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:09.100
Make sure you're in a well- lit room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:23.970
When I open this door
Kono doa akereba atarashii sekai ga

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:27.860
A brand new world is starting right now
Ima hajimarunda

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:34.440
Even if there are painful things on my way
Tsurai koto ga aru toshitemo

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:40.840
I will show you that I can overcome them all
Kitto norikoetemiseru

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:48.600
I'm starting to walk on a brand new world now
Atarashii sekai ni ima arukidashita soko ha

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:54.830
And I'm sure there are [Dreams] and [Hope] there
[Yume] ya [Kibou] ga aru kara

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:58.050
This feeling is making my heart beat so fast
Dokidoki suru kono kimochi

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:01.180
And there's no one who can stop it
darenimo tomerarenai

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:06.200
My heart is tightening and jumping all over the place
Kyun to hazumu kokoro

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:10.560
So start flapping your wings from now
Koko kara habataiteiku

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:13.610
and soar high to the sky up there
ano sora he to takaku

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:19.580
Aiming for [Tomorrow] and [The Future] beyond
[Ashita] [Mirai] mezashite

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:22.910
We will definitely grow bigger someday
Itsuka ookiku nareru to

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:26.180
That's what I believed
sou shinjiteiru no

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:31.340
That's why, just spread your wings
Dakara tsubasa wo hiroge

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:54.750
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:57.500
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:04.070
<i>In order to bring peace back to Deltora, I defeated evil monsters and recovered the topaz, ruby and opal!</i>

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:07.090
<i>Honestly... You're always just being reckless though.</i>

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:07.840
<i>Jasmine!</i>

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:10.040
<i>It's all thanks to me that you even got this far.</i>

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:11.600
<i>And don't forget about me either.</i>

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:12.500
<i>Barda!</i>

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:15.600
<i>Filli! Kree!</i>

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:20.200
<i>We are in the middle of our journey to search for the seven gems!</i>

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:24.750
<i>And right now, we're on our way to the
Shifting Sands where the fourth gem is hidden!</i>

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:47.900
Hey, you're being too rough, Carn 8! Take it slow!

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:53.250
Will you relax? You want to get this done as soon as possible as well, right?

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:10.210
What's going on here...? Why am I bound...?

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:13.910
That's right... We fell through a trap door, and...

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:16.800
Shit...!

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:23.000
They should be waking up soon right, Carn 8?

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:29.500
Probably, Carn 2. Although, I don't mind knocking them out cold again if they don't behave.

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:31.900
Who are these people...?

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:34.300
What are they planning to do to us...?

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:36.280
The belt...!

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:44.020
Thank goodness. The belt is safe.

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:46.300
What about Jasmine and Barda?!

00:03:49.230 --> 00:03:51.220
Seems like they're safe too...

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:56.380
But Carn 8, do you think that they're really worth the trouble?

00:03:56.380 --> 00:04:01.340
The big guy might be worth something, but the other two don't look very impressive.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.050
Especially the girl.

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:09.240
Yeah, I could hardly believe that this girl was really this year's Champion. I thought I must have misheard.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:15.910
Regardless, our only job is to transport the goods we got from Mother Brightly to the Shadowlands.

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:21.100
The Shadowlands...?! Then does that mean that these guys are Grey Guards?!

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:25.120
But, to think that Mother Brightly was in cahoots with them...

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:34.900
Kree! You're here!

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:37.930
Shit... Damn that Mother Brightly...!

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:41.550
It's useless! I can't free myself from this!

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:53.200
Seriously? Why now of all times?

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:55.950
Oh well. Guess we'll take a break around here.

00:04:56.340 --> 00:05:03.000
Besides, it's about time we gave those guys some food. I don't want to be left for dead just because we let them wither away.

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:12.480
Hey, be careful! Don't give them any new injuries that weren't in Mother Brightly's report!

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:17.310
Otherwise <i>we'll</i>  be the ones getting thrown in the Shadow Arena.

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:21.200
Would you prefer to fight the beast in their place?

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:22.900
N-No way!

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.230
Fight the beast...?

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:27.840
This is no joke for us...!

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:33.650
So even those games weren't safe from the Shadow Lord's evil grasp, huh...

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:47.580
Give them some food, will you?

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:50.490
What a pain in the ass...

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:04.060
Don't tell me... Are they seriously going to feed us that dirty, dried meat?

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:08.060
It's still an improvement over whatever that weird thing is.

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:14.010
Shit... If only I weren't bound by these chains!

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:28.990
Here you go. Be grateful.

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:32.430
How are we supposed to eat when we're bound like this?

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:38.850
Be quiet. One more word and we'll throw you into the Shifting Sands.

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:40.830
We're not too far from there, after all.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:44.320
The Shifting Sands...

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:46.950
Lief, did you just hear that?

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:47.880
Y-Yeah.

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:52.900
Seems like this place is rather close to the Shifting Sands...

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:57.240
Even so, there's nothing we can do about it while we're bound like this.

00:06:57.510 --> 00:07:01.100
Anyway, that Mother Brightly sure did us in...

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:04.010
And she really did seem like a kind person...

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:11.910
And to think that that tournament is just a big, elaborate trap, with gold coins as bait to lure the participants.

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:15.980
Come to think of it, Orwen did say something about...

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:21.070
<i>I heard that last year's Chapion went missing, didn't he?</i>

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:25.630
They must have kidnapped the previous winners and taken them to the Shadow Lands!

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:27.880
Those dirty bastards!

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:30.740
Shh! Look at them!

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:36.690
They're sleeping?

00:07:36.690 --> 00:07:37.740
Probably...

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:41.250
This is the perfect chance for us to escape.

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:43.430
Yeah, if only we didn't have these...

00:07:56.650 --> 00:08:03.270
At this rate, we'll be taken to the Shadowlands, and then I'd have to hand the belt over to them just like that...

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:09.900
What was that sound...?

00:08:10.430 --> 00:08:11.910
Maybe someone's there...?

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:15.520
You...!

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:16.300
Doom!

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:18.050
Why are you here?!

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:22.200
Are you still bitter about your loss?

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:27.000
Be quiet and don't move until I say so.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.600
Do as I say and you'll be freed.

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:32.790
Why are you saving us?

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:34.380
We'll talk later.

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:35.700
But...!

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:41.400
We've already secured your weapons and belongings elsewhere.

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:47.000
We'll remove your bonds right away. After that, please try to follow us as fast as you can.

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:51.900
Weren't you... the guy who brought the cider at the tournament...?

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:54.350
You seem quite different now, though.

00:08:54.350 --> 00:09:01.290
My name is Dain. It's probably because I acted in a way back then that would make you drink the cider.

00:09:01.780 --> 00:09:02.910
What do you mean...?

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:07.520
To tell you the truth, we actually planned for you to fall unconscious as well.

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:13.760
According to our plans, that bestial man Glock was
supposed to be the victor of this year's tournament.

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:20.200
However, thanks to you, our plans went awry, and I had to lose to you on purpose.

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:26.860
Except that in the end, your loss ended up being legitimate. Am I wrong?

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:31.250
Certainly, your agility is impressive. However, can you say the same for your strength?

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:32.220
What?!

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:35.830
At any rate, we need to leave this place now.

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:39.880
Just who are you two...?

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:45.300
As for myself, I'm the leader of The Resistance, the only organisation that opposes the Shadow Lord.

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:46.690
The Resistance's...?!

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:49.510
And I am one of its members.

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:54.330
But then, why was a member of The Resistance participating in the Rithmere Games?

00:09:54.960 --> 00:10:00.160
We have had the suspicion for a while now that there is more to that tournament than meets the eye.

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:04.100
That's why I infiltrated it as one of its participants.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.300
So, what will you do?

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:13.500
I doubt you'll have another chance to escape.

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:20.480
There's still one thing that I don't understand; <i>why</i>  are you saving us?

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:25.870
Because I've been interested in you three ever since I saw you in Tom's Shop.

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:39.430
After that, I kept hearing rumors about a certain trio wherever I went.

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:46.000
Rumors about a man, a boy, and a wild girl who were on a journey with a black bird.

00:10:47.610 --> 00:10:54.460
And that wherever those three travellers appear, the Shadow Lord's evil is certain to be undone.

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:00.850
Please do.

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:05.500
There's a good hiding place nearby.

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:07.900
Let's head there first.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:24.850
They've found us, huh?

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:51.750
Stop right there!

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:53.210
Stop running!

00:11:57.680 --> 00:12:02.910
Now! Raise your hands and surrender if you don't want to be burned alive!

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:08.500
Don't make us repeat ourselves! Put your hands up!

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:12.140
Won't you guys be in trouble if you injure us?

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:14.720
Better than having to let you go.

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:18.580
Now, hurry up and surrender, otherwise I'll burn you to ashes with this!

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:21.210
Please stop! Anything but that!

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:23.900
Good call, kid.

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:28.810
Seems like the boy understands the situation here. What about you two?

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:31.200
I surrender too.

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:34.080
What? Fine, me too.

00:12:34.890 --> 00:12:35.560
Good.

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:47.550
Shit! They had comrades in hiding?!

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:51.630
We won't forget this...!

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:54.140
Now, let's go.

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:56.170
O-Okay...

00:13:16.360 --> 00:13:18.850
Now, my thoughts are that...

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:25.410
It would be best if we head to The Resistance's base of operations for now to discuss this matter further.

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:31.100
They will definitely pursue you three without fail.

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:34.370
So it's better to have more allies, don't you think?

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:39.210
Don't forget that we still can't trust you two completely yet.

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:48.200
You're not the only one with a dagger here, you know?

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:50.900
It's just a joke.

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:56.290
But at least tell us your reason for rejecting our offer.

00:13:56.980 --> 00:14:00.700
We did go to the trouble of saving you from danger, after all.

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:02.420
Actually, we're...

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:07.900
Lief, stop. These guys are still not trustworthy enough to hear that.

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:10.610
Then what? Do you want to continue the match from before?

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:15.150
Sure, I'll show you that there's more to me than just agility...!

00:14:15.310 --> 00:14:16.980
You sure can talk.

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:21.480
Jasmine, stop!

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:25.080
No way! Don't forget that this guy did nothing,

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:28.800
When we were trapped in Mother Brightly's inn!

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:34.440
There was nothing that I could have done. We didn't know what kind of traps would have been waiting for us there!

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:44.620
Please stop this! What are you doing, picking a fight with potential allies like that?!

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:47.690
Don't be so upset. It's just a bit of fun.

00:14:48.270 --> 00:14:51.370
I'm very sorry for our rudeness!

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:55.500
However, please, at least believe in our goal.

00:14:55.500 --> 00:15:00.330
Our goal to save every single citizen of Deltora that is being oppressed by the Shadow Lord.

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:09.000
Even so, I still don't think that it's a good idea for us to go to your headquarters for now.

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:13.090
As you are fully aware, we are wanted by the Shadow Lord.

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:18.010
It would be best, for your sake, to stay away from us.

00:15:21.570 --> 00:15:29.010
That's very unfortunate. I really thought that we could become a good team.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:31.610
Well, sorry to disappoint you then.

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:32.400
Let's go.

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:41.490
We're grateful to you guys for having saved us. However, we can't go with you right now.

00:15:45.330 --> 00:15:45.980
Wait.

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:53.000
Never tell anyone what I have told you today.

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:59.870
Otherwise, I will personally ensure that you'll wish you had gone to the Shadowlands instead.

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:12.940
Just what's with him? Threatening us like that...

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:20.920
He's probably quite upset with us. I don't think they themselves trust others very easily either,

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:24.500
Even so, they still trusted us and saved us.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:25.600
And yet...

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:28.400
We couldn't return that trust.

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:34.860
Joining hands with Doom means sharing the details of our quest with them.

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:39.150
And now is not the time to be doing something so dangerous.

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:40.090
I know that, but...

00:16:40.510 --> 00:16:46.730
What's the problem? We've always travelled with just the three of us anyway, right? Plus, I still don't trust that shady old man.

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:54.990
But then again, I have a feeling that they will definitely become strong allies at the end of this journey.

00:16:54.990 --> 00:17:00.490
Anyway, right now we have to head to the Shifting Sands, where the fourth gem is hidden.

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:05.870
But which direction are we supposed to go in? We don't even have the stars to guide us...

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:09.290
Guys, have you forgotten that we have Kree here?

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:18.050
I bet he knows where we are. He's been following us this whole way, after all.

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:30.590
It's a river!

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:35.490
Kree says to cross it.

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:38.900
I'm sure the Shifting Sands are on the other side of this forest!

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:44.900
This is good! We can use this river to erase our scent so that our pursuers can't track us anymore!

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:45.580
Let's go!

00:18:04.420 --> 00:18:06.450
Is that where the Shifting Sands are...?

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:07.970
I hope so...

00:18:08.260 --> 00:18:09.650
Then what are we waiting for?

00:18:13.090 --> 00:18:17.600
Geez, if you don't hurry up then those Grey Guards will catch up to us!

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:23.280
I really am exhausted.

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:26.990
Well, of course you would be after getting all excited like that.

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:31.900
The peak of the mountain is still quite far.

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:40.210
What is it? Did you find something over there?

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:48.220
Hey, look at this!

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:50.500
A stone monument...?

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:52.300
Something is written here.

00:18:58.050 --> 00:19:00.610
"The Shifting Sands... Dan... ger..."

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:04.600
I can read that just fine, but the rest I don't understand.

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:09.400
I think the first word in the next line probably spells "Death", so...

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:17.810
"Death swarms within its rocky wall... Where all are one, one will rules all"...?

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:21.250
What is it trying to say?

00:19:22.710 --> 00:19:24.240
I'm not really sure...

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:27.300
But, regardless...

00:19:31.860 --> 00:19:35.850
Now that we've read that, it's clear that the Shifting Sands isn't a pleasant place.

00:19:35.850 --> 00:19:40.910
Oh really? I already knew that the Shifting Sands wouldn't be a nice place from the very beginning.

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:42.370
You did?

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:43.770
For sure.

00:19:47.230 --> 00:19:52.280
Hey, come to think of it, this stone monument said something about a rocky wall, didn't it?

00:19:52.280 --> 00:19:52.980
Yeah.

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:54.670
What about it?

00:19:57.300 --> 00:20:04.000
Could it be that it's actually referring to that grey wall- like mountain in the distance?

00:20:05.990 --> 00:20:08.200
That certainly could be considered a 'wall'...

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:13.200
If that's really the case, then it would mean that the Shifting Sands are on the other side of it.

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:14.200
Let's check it out!

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:16.230
Alright, let's go.

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:25.700
It's just up ahead.

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:39.330
So this is the grey mountain that we saw back there...?

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:46.890
It literally is a wall... No doubt about it, this must be the rocky wall that was mentioned on that stone monument!

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:49.490
But, that means we'll have to climb this, right?

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:55.330
Just a bit further...!

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:56.000
Yeah.

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:58.410
Be careful, you might slip.

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:10.170
Incredible... We're even higher than the clouds now.

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:20.210
And we still have to get down from here...

00:21:20.950 --> 00:21:22.090
Let's keep moving.

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:37.110
Look! Right ahead!

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:47.730
No doubt about it... It's the Shifting Sands!

00:21:47.730 --> 00:21:50.350
We're here... We're finally here!

00:21:50.570 --> 00:21:52.030
Yeah, we did it!

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:01.860
Huh? What was that sound?

00:22:01.860 --> 00:22:02.640
What sound?

00:22:02.640 --> 00:22:05.420
You can't hear it? It's like something is buzzing...

00:22:13.420 --> 00:22:15.190
I don't hear anything though...

00:22:15.400 --> 00:22:17.120
Yeah, neither do I...

00:22:17.720 --> 00:22:18.900
Seriously...?

00:22:19.300 --> 00:22:20.700
I really can hear something!

00:22:24.280 --> 00:22:26.600
Just what in the world is this sound...?

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:40.390
Every moment is a gate to fantasia
Every moment is a gate to fantasia

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:47.690
You just do it to be an shining star
You just do it to be an shining star

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:51.050
Ooh la la! The gentle wind that's brushing my cheek in the evening
Ooh la la! Yawarakana kaze hoo naderu yuugata

00:22:51.050 --> 00:22:53.560
If you start to walk with your head held high
Moshi kimi ga uemuki arukidasu nara

00:22:53.560 --> 00:22:57.980
The big red sun will surely give its blessing to you
Ooki na akai taiyou ga kimi wo shukufuku shitekureru darou

00:22:57.980 --> 00:23:00.480
If you stay stricken because you stumbled
